 "about": "The drawings for RC2's Figure lines, by chapter (path from manuscript/), in the order of the chapter's Figure lines; null where none is drawn yet, or where the Figure line names its own lab/ drawing. Read by build_book.py --cast --figures. From the designer's 088, 089, 091, 095, 096, 098, 099 and 100, and ruv-sgit's 044 and 045 (2 November 2026). The seventy's slots (rc2/70/...) copied from the designer's proposal lab/tools/book/rc2-70-figures.json (its 101 to 103; ruv-sgit's map slide and one wake, its 049; chapter 7's three rounds ruv-sgit's drawn copy, its 048), checked against the chapters and the lab/ rules. Chapters whose Figure lines changed (writer 074) are matched to the designer's notes by each line's opening words, a drawing kept only on an exact match. Overrides: the 'overrides' key holds the publisher's own placements (chapter: {opening words of a Figure line: drawing}), applied after each copy of the designer's list; the build reads chapter keys only.",
